# The tools image is built with the repository root as its context, because
# scripts/install_tools.py and tools.lock live there. Only those four files belong in it:
# anything else would be sent to the daemon and, worse, would bust the image's build cache
# on an unrelated commit.
*
!tools.lock
!tools/tools.sha256
!scripts/tool_specs.py
!scripts/install_tools.py
